# src/apps/daemon/internal/analysis/speedtest

## Purpose
Implements daemon-side network speed and throughput measurement used for diagnostics and path evaluation.

## Contents
Contains Go measurement routines, result models, and helpers for executing bounded speed tests and reporting observations.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Consumed by daemon analysis/API/workflow layers and depends on networking primitives, timers, and context cancellation.

## Invariants
Measurements are bounded and cancellable, partial or failed probes remain distinguishable from successful results, and temporary network resources are released on every exit path.